I was always under the impression that it was impossible to copy
save files since the game would see that you had copied the file
(by comparing timestamps or something), but it seems that it is
now possible (nh3-pl6 on Sun3) to copy save files. Is this a bug
or a new feature to allow people to clutter up the high scores
board with bogus scores? (I have solved the problem by changing
the file permissions to owner (me) write only, and setting the 
sticky bit on the nethack executable so that it executes as me).

 
